    "detailed_description": "Dusty\u2019s Sweeping Cleanup is an action and racing inspired experience about cleaning your way around the house. Take control of Dusty the Robot Vacuum and trace your own path in a variety of fast paced and open environments. <br><br>This game was made in 15 weeks by a small group of students in Montr\u00e9al, Canada.<br><br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Robot Movement: Boost, drift and jump with Dusty\u2019s momentum-based movement.<br></li><li>Robot Cleaning: Earn points by cleaning the floor and by sucking up a variety of objects in your environment.<br></li><li>House-Based Levels: Clean your way through different rooms, each with their own unique layout and obstacles to overcome.<br></li><li>Breaking objects: Break objects to create even more stuff to clean up!<br></li><li>Collectibles: For the completionists, try to find all the special collectibles in each level.<br></li><li>Secrets: Find hidden passages scattered around the house, with many secrets waiting to be revealed.</li></ul>",
